Package: wide-dhcpv6-relay
Version: 20080615-2
Depends: libc, libssp, kmod-ipv6
Source: package/dni/wide-dhcpv6
Section: dni
Architecture: ipq
Installed-Size: 24389
Description:  WIDE-DHCPv6 is an open-source implementation of Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol
 for IPv6 (DHCPv6) originally developed by the KAME project. The implementation
 mainly conforms to the following standards: RFC3315,3319,3633,3646,4075,4272,etc.
 
 This package installs the relay component.
